# ── The corpus ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RAW DATA IS NOT PUBLISHED. The camera streams (marker positions, the infrared
# video) and the inertial streams are ~7.6 GB and are held outside the
# repository. What IS published is everything derived from them: the annotation,
# the ground truth, and the per-session files needed to read those.
#
# Excluded on size rather than on principle: smoothed.csv is the per-frame
# reference track (118 MB over the corpus) and the per-session audit images are
# a further 165 MB. Two sample sessions carry both, so the pipeline can be run
# end to end from the repository alone; see datasets/README.md.
datasets/*
!datasets/*.csv
!datasets/*.md
!datasets/*.png
!datasets/session_*/
datasets/session_*/*
!datasets/session_*/annotation_*.csv
!datasets/session_*/metadata.json
!datasets/session_*/rotation.json
!datasets/session_*/sync_map.csv
!datasets/session_*/manifest.json
!datasets/session_*/CHECKSUMS.sha256
!datasets/session_*/events.jsonl

# The two sample sessions, complete enough to run the pipeline on
!datasets/session_20260510_121411/smoothed.csv
!datasets/session_20260510_121411/audit_*.png
!datasets/session_20260520_142117/smoothed.csv
!datasets/session_20260520_142117/audit_*.png
